(6901117, 1040415, 123348, '<td valign="top">Not sure why, but this one completely draws me in. I know the wood grain is computerized and yet the effect fascinates me! This is so strange that I will give it a 10 for the creepy effect...indeed it is very creepy! Well done!</td>', 'Not sure why, but this one completely draws me in. I know the wood grain is computerized and yet the effect fascinates me! This is so strange that I will give it a 10 for the creepy effect...indeed it is very creepy! Well done!', '2012-11-07 17:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
