(6901406, 1040283, 65234, '<td valign="top">Is the cat hanging out in some sort of torture chamber?  ''Cuz that chain does not look like something I''d expect in a "normal" house.<br/> <br/>Nice light on the cat.</td>', 'Is the cat hanging out in some sort of torture chamber?  ''Cuz that chain does not look like something I''d expect in a "normal" house. Nice light on the cat.', '2012-11-07 21:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
