(6902001, 1040019, 108991, '<td valign="top">To my personal taste, the mouth is overdone,  but the upperhalf of the face makes a forceful picture nonetheless. High marks!</td>', 'To my personal taste, the mouth is overdone,  but the upperhalf of the face makes a forceful picture nonetheless. High marks!', '2012-11-08 11:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902008, 1040472, 108991, '<td valign="top">Halloween is not part of my culture and perhaps that''s why the iconography of this photo doesn''t appeal much to me. But in spite of this I do see an interestingly lit indoor night scene, reminiscent of Gregory Crewdson. Well done, so.</td>', 'Halloween is not part of my culture and perhaps that''s why the iconography of this photo doesn''t appeal much to me. But in spite of this I do see an interestingly lit indoor night scene, reminiscent of Gregory Crewdson. Well done, so.', '2012-11-08 11:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902025, 1040467, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Colors and PP are top notch on this portrait of an angry looking man. I was looking at the two halves and wondering what was supposed to be so creepy. Both are mirror images of one half.....then I noticed the split and the third eye peeking out from the center.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Colors and PP are top notch on this portrait of an angry looking man. I was looking at the two halves and wondering what was supposed to be so creepy. Both are mirror images of one half.....then I noticed the split and the third eye peeking out from the center.', '2012-11-08 11:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902030, 1040474, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>The colors and the fiery action in the backdrop behind the gents grabs my attention. Guy Fawkes Day perhaps? It is an interesting shot with two gents dressed in period costume. I wonder what exactly is on the sign that the gent is holding and is he going to place it on the bonfire. I just wish that you captured both men in a stance were we could see faces and expressions better.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. The colors and the fiery action in the backdrop behind the gents grabs my attention. Guy Fawkes Day perhaps? It is an interesting shot with two gents dressed in period costume. I wonder what exactly is on the sign that the gent is holding and is he going to place it on the bonfire. I just wish that you captured both men in a stance were we could see faces and expressions better.', '2012-11-08 12:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902031, 1040324, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>The green hue project an errie and scary mood which complements the subject of the photo. This is one bathroom stall that I would take one quick glance at and then do a quick step out of the room.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. The green hue project an errie and scary mood which complements the subject of the photo. This is one bathroom stall that I would take one quick glance at and then do a quick step out of the room.', '2012-11-08 12:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902035, 1040019, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Lighting and details on the face of this young girl are fabulous. The blonde tresses that curl down around her oval face, the freckles, and the startling blue eyes do indeed paint a picture of young innocence. But then there are the little sinister details that tells the audience all is not so innocent. The staring eyes, the black veil, and the dribble of blood coming from the lips all speak of something lurking behind the innocence.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Lighting and details on the face of this young girl are fabulous. The blonde tresses that curl down around her oval face, the freckles, and the startling blue eyes do indeed paint a picture of young innocence. But then there are the little sinister details that tells the audience all is not so innocent. The staring eyes, the black veil, and the dribble of blood coming from the lips all speak of something lurking behind the innocence.', '2012-11-08 12:07:22.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6902040, 1040445, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>The big, bad demon wolf coming at you to stab with that wicked knife - definitely a scary and run for your life type shot. The lighting is fabulous. You have great dynamic tones in the shadows and highlights in the B&amp;W. The low angle makes it appear that this demon wolf is towering over us as we cower on the floor. Top notch and high marks for a scary Halloween composition. My only critique is that I wish you removed the watch on the right hand:-)</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. The big, bad demon wolf coming at you to stab with that wicked knife - definitely a scary and run for your life type shot. The lighting is fabulous. You have great dynamic tones in the shadows and highlights in the B&W. The low angle makes it appear that this demon wolf is towering over us as we cower on the floor. Top notch and high marks for a scary Halloween composition. My only critique is that I wish you removed the watch on the right hand:-)', '2012-11-08 12:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902043, 1040477, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Heh, I recognize the title as a quote from Dirty Dancing. But the imagery is far, far from any romantic human interest story. Geez, the face on the doll in the backdrop is creepy and dangerous. Great lighting to add a sinister and spooky mood to the overall scene. The little girl is curled up asleep and unaware of the danger that lurks behind her.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Heh, I recognize the title as a quote from Dirty Dancing. But the imagery is far, far from any romantic human interest story. Geez, the face on the doll in the backdrop is creepy and dangerous. Great lighting to add a sinister and spooky mood to the overall scene. The little girl is curled up asleep and unaware of the danger that lurks behind her.', '2012-11-08 12:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902127, 1040398, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>What a fun and great composition! Love the two pumpkins that are ''talking'' to one another. The laughing pumpkin on the left even seems to have laugh lines at the tip of his smile:-) Great colors and clarity. My only critique is I wish there was a greater DOF such that the house in the backdrop was a little more blurred. That way the pumpkins could stand out/pop even more.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. What a fun and great composition! Love the two pumpkins that are ''talking'' to one another. The laughing pumpkin on the left even seems to have laugh lines at the tip of his smile:-) Great colors and clarity. My only critique is I wish there was a greater DOF such that the house in the backdrop was a little more blurred. That way the pumpkins could stand out/pop even more.', '2012-11-08 13:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902178, 1040467, 131871, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. :)</td>', 'Cool idea. :)', '2012-11-08 15:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902184, 1039798, 131871, '<td valign="top">love the makeup!</td>', 'love the makeup!', '2012-11-08 15:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902197, 1039942, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the colors, shapes and the composition of this pumpkin patch. However, I feel it has potential to be even better. The lighting is a bit harsh in spots and the contrasts between highlights &amp; shadows could be richer and deeper if you made some adjustments to shadows/midtones/highlights.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the colors, shapes and the composition of this pumpkin patch. However, I feel it has potential to be even better. The lighting is a bit harsh in spots and the contrasts between highlights & shadows could be richer and deeper if you made some adjustments to shadows/midtones/highlights.', '2012-11-08 15:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902207, 1039761, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment. <br/> <br/>Love the composition and the PP on the car to give it a textured aged look. The skeleton adds the halloween touch to the scene. I think that this had potential for greater visual impact if you added a little bit of age/texture to the bone white skeleton that seems to stick out because it does not fit with the PP of the rest of the scene. Taking the texture/colors of the top right and overlaying it over the skeleton at an opacity of 20 -40% (recommend playing with to see what works better) would have added a textural dimension that would have made it ''fit'' better into the scene. Lastly, I think this would have been a great opportunity to take advantage of the Expert Editing rule-set to erase the line on the skeleton''s forehead so that it appears whole.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment.  Love the composition and the PP on the car to give it a textured aged look. The skeleton adds the halloween touch to the scene. I think that this had potential for greater visual impact if you added a little bit of age/texture to the bone white skeleton that seems to stick out because it does not fit with the PP of the rest of the scene. Taking the texture/colors of the top right and overlaying it over the skeleton at an opacity of 20 -40% (recommend playing with to see what works better) would have added a textural dimension that would have made it ''fit'' better into the scene. Lastly, I think this would have been a great opportunity to take advantage of the Expert Editing rule-set to erase the line on the skeleton''s forehead so that it appears whole.', '2012-11-08 15:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902215, 1039943, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Very cute little girl - great clarity in the details and the eyes. The colors and skin tones are excellent. Now that said it is a great portrait shot but it doesn''t scream Halloween 100%. I do see the two boys dressed in costume on either side of her but they are not the main focus/subject of the shot; the little girl is. I think if you took the shot on the vertical that we, the audience, could see the trick or treat bag/pumpkin in her hand it would have more strongly associated the photo with Halloween.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Very cute little girl - great clarity in the details and the eyes. The colors and skin tones are excellent. Now that said it is a great portrait shot but it doesn''t scream Halloween 100%. I do see the two boys dressed in costume on either side of her but they are not the main focus/subject of the shot; the little girl is. I think if you took the shot on the vertical that we, the audience, could see the trick or treat bag/pumpkin in her hand it would have more strongly associated the photo with Halloween.', '2012-11-08 15:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902228, 1040045, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the light</td>', 'Love the light', '2012-11-08 15:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902230, 1040283, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>This is a great photo of this calico cat. However, there are not many strong visual clues/cues in the photo to associate this capture with Halloween. I am looking in the cat''s eye to see if there is something there (which there may be) but it is too small to make out what might be reflected there. I know animals have been said to sense paranormal things but this cat doesn''t look frightened or threatened. It is just sitting there calmly. I do see the chains in the backdrop but again how does this connect with the cat and what it sees? I feel the image has potential but just need stronger visual cues within the photo to strongly associate this with Halloween or something spooky.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. This is a great photo of this calico cat. However, there are not many strong visual clues/cues in the photo to associate this capture with Halloween. I am looking in the cat''s eye to see if there is something there (which there may be) but it is too small to make out what might be reflected there. I know animals have been said to sense paranormal things but this cat doesn''t look frightened or threatened. It is just sitting there calmly. I do see the chains in the backdrop but again how does this connect with the cat and what it sees? I feel the image has potential but just need stronger visual cues within the photo to strongly associate this with Halloween or something spooky.', '2012-11-08 15:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
