(6904584, 1040113, 63218, '<td valign="top">No treats for you, you have no mouth. I''m glad I didn''t get any of these at my front door, or if I did I couldn''t see them because the porch light was on. It''s much more likely that there''s one lurking in my closet, or under the bed. Truly scary.</td>', 'No treats for you, you have no mouth. I''m glad I didn''t get any of these at my front door, or if I did I couldn''t see them because the porch light was on. It''s much more likely that there''s one lurking in my closet, or under the bed. Truly scary.', '2012-11-12 10:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
