(6905523, 1039761, 63218, '<td valign="top">This would look good hanging on the wall somewhere. Very well done composition. There is a lot of color here, excellent contrast, interesting arrangement of line, shape, &amp; tone. Keeps my eye moving all around, exploring. I''m not a fan of descriptive titles, so I think you could''ve done better with that. In my mind, the paper white of the bone, the arrangement of the red, blue, yellow, green, &amp; black, work perfectly together with the lines, shapes, &amp; tones. Perfectly.<br/> <br/>You get the Flying Pig award for a fine art composition.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1038123" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This would look good hanging on the wall somewhere. Very well done composition. There is a lot of color here, excellent contrast, interesting arrangement of line, shape, & tone. Keeps my eye moving all around, exploring. I''m not a fan of descriptive titles, so I think you could''ve done better with that. In my mind, the paper white of the bone, the arrangement of the red, blue, yellow, green, & black, work perfectly together with the lines, shapes, & tones. Perfectly. You get the Flying Pig award for a fine art composition.', '2012-11-13 23:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
