(6905960, 1040468, 77196, '<td valign="top">If anyone cares, the two "ghosts" are in the upper right quarter of the image. I cloned parts of the wallpaper pattern to create the lower ghost and then cloned it as the upper ghost. I think the image was too dark on most monitors to see the ghosts, and area just looks like blank black. <br/>BTW - This was taken at the Auburn Cord Duesenberg Museum in Auburn, Indiana. The showroom has been restored to its original art deco glory, and this is one of the original lights.</td>', 'If anyone cares, the two "ghosts" are in the upper right quarter of the image. I cloned parts of the wallpaper pattern to create the lower ghost and then cloned it as the upper ghost. I think the image was too dark on most monitors to see the ghosts, and area just looks like blank black. BTW - This was taken at the Auburn Cord Duesenberg Museum in Auburn, Indiana. The showroom has been restored to its original art deco glory, and this is one of the original lights.', '2012-11-14 09:11:22.000000', NULL, 0),
