(6906307, 1040472, 114969, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Samantha! I really love this one: so much to looks at! The way you integrated all the various monsters is wonderfully subtle and clever. Can''t wait to see your next creation!</td>', 'Congratulations Samantha! I really love this one: so much to looks at! The way you integrated all the various monsters is wonderfully subtle and clever. Can''t wait to see your next creation!', '2012-11-14 15:56:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6906331, 1040038, 114969, '<td valign="top">We all know that the worst thing for a work of art is to be ignored. Obviously yours is a great success! Congratulations on the much deserved ribbon. You obviously don''t need my advice about that, but please ignore those that are much better at getting noticed with their provocative words, than with their photos. Can''t wait to see your next creation.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-11-14 16:31:45.</i></td>', 'We all know that the worst thing for a work of art is to be ignored. Obviously yours is a great success! Congratulations on the much deserved ribbon. You obviously don''t need my advice about that, but please ignore those that are much better at getting noticed with their provocative words, than with their photos. Can''t wait to see your next creation.', '2012-11-14 16:15:19.000000', '2012-11-14 16:31:45.000000', 0),
(6906339, 1040038, 54645, '<td valign="top">Congrats. The you behind your bum must be bummed to be bummed by his own bum. :) Ignore the hate mail. Always a plus to piss off a few voters. You did good.</td>', 'Congrats. The you behind your bum must be bummed to be bummed by his own bum. :) Ignore the hate mail. Always a plus to piss off a few voters. You did good.', '2012-11-14 16:19:24.000000', NULL, 0),
