(6906761, 1040019, 108991, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Tommy_mac:</b></div><hr/><i>Beyond the blood I really didn''t do anything else besides the color...I tried blacking out the eyes and even enlarging them, but it just didn''t look right. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Really? I imagined to see skulls in the catchlights of her eyes!</td>', 'Originally posted by Tommy_mac:Beyond the blood I really didn''t do anything else besides the color...I tried blacking out the eyes and even enlarging them, but it just didn''t look right.   Really? I imagined to see skulls in the catchlights of her eyes!', '2012-11-15 08:43:15.000000', NULL, 0),
